        "id": "textbook-chapter-summary",
        "moduleId": "api-recap",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "summary",
        "title": "教材小结：创建进程的三个 API",
        "markdown": "本章介绍了在 UNIX 系统中创建进程所需的 API：`fork()`、`exec()` 和 `wait()`。\n\n教材同时指出，更多细节可以阅读 Stevens 和 Rago 的著作，尤其是关于进程控制、进程关系及信号的章节。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000062"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "操作系统导论",
                "小结"
              ],
              "lineStart": 1746,
              "lineEnd": 1749,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "dfd018fc3d5dd55fc1593e0f26bfc6d0d3c61f5e0a4a407e89d4f4d531178ce2"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-api-roles",
        "moduleId": "api-recap",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：三个调用各自负责什么",
        "markdown": "把三个 API 放回一次进程控制流程中看：`fork()` 复制出子进程，`exec()` 用新程序替换当前进程的映像，`wait()` 让父进程等待子进程结束并取得退出状态。\n\n三者职责分离，正是它们可以灵活组合的原因。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-chapter-summary"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-shell-composition",
        "moduleId": "api-recap",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "application",
        "title": "补充：shell 如何组合这些 API",
        "markdown": "一个典型的 shell 执行用户命令的流程是：shell 调用 `fork()` 创建子进程；子进程调用 `exec()` 装载命令程序；父进程调用 `wait()` 等待命令结束，再继续显示提示符。\n\n这条链路把教材中的三个 API 串成一个完整的控制循环。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-chapter-summary",
            "model-api-roles"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-references",
        "moduleId": "further-reading",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "教材参考资料",
        "markdown": "教材列出四份延伸资料：Conway 1963 年关于多处理器系统设计的论文，Dennis 与 Van Horn 1966 年关于多道程序语义的文章，Lampson 1983 年的系统设计建议，以及 Stevens 与 Rago 2005 年的《Advanced Programming in the UNIX Environment》。\n\n其中 Stevens 与 Rago 的著作被教材推荐为查询 UNIX API 细节的首选。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
